{{ template "chart.description" . }}

This Helm library generates Argo CD Applications for Helm charts and raw-manifest
directories. The root consumer chart and its `extras/` chart use the same project name;
each generated Application includes the cluster name only when configured.

## Quick start

Pin the same release in the root and `extras/Chart.yaml`, the latest release tag for a new
environment; `<version>` shows the syntax:

```yaml
apiVersion: v2
name: contoso
type: application
version: 1.0.0
appVersion: "1.0.0"
dependencies:
  - name: argocd-gitops-tpl-library
    version: <version>
    repository: oci://registry-1.docker.io/grootantech
```

Then build dependencies and render the charts:

```sh
helm dependency update .
helm dependency update extras/
helm lint --strict .
helm lint --strict extras/
helm template contoso .
helm template contoso-extras extras/
```

