## Reading with an AI assistant

Start here, select the relevant task, and follow only the linked pages needed for it.
Resolve relative links from the containing document and keep every page on the same
branch, tag, commit or local checkout, including uncommitted edits. Do not concatenate `docs/`.
Read the release the environment's `Chart.yaml` pins, or the latest release tag for a new
environment; never the highest version in the registry, which can be a candidate.
Generated names, namespaces and values paths are what `helm template` renders at that release.
For upgrades, also read [MIGRATION.md](./MIGRATION.md) and [CHANGELOG.md](./CHANGELOG.md).
Tools read how a service is added and what its values file may override from
[docs/environment-map.json](./docs/environment-map.json) at that same ref.

